ide promising clues about someone or something being sought.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"hot","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Served at a high temperature after being heated or cooked.","siblings":[{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a high temperature or a temperature higher than is comfortable."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Recent enough to provide promising clues about someone or something being sought."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T23:23:32.788Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:23:28.345Z', '2026-11-10T06:50:19.978Z', NULL);
