al, fluent text in its language."}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"bird","pos":"noun","gloss":"A shuttlecock used in badminton.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal with feathers, wings, and a beak that lays eggs and is usually able to fly."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A girl or young woman."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular type or character."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Time spent in prison."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T08:29:56.404Z"}', '2026-11-10T08:11:23.162Z', '2026-11-10T08:29:56.404Z', NULL);
