he word in another sense), or is not natural, fluent text in its language."}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"hot","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very bright and strong in colour.","siblings":[{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a high temperature or a temperature higher than is comfortable."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Recent enough to provide promising clues about someone or something being sought."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a strong taste that causes a burning feeling in the mouth."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very popular, fashionable, or in great demand."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Causing strong disagreement, excitement, or public interest."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Sexually attractive."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Feeling strong sexual desire."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Stolen and therefore risky to possess or sell."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very skilful at a particular activity or knowledgeable about a particular subject."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Newly obtained or produced and very recent."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Involving intense activity, competition, or emotion."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very interested in or eager for something."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very likely to win or succeed."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Strict or insistent about making sure a rule or standard is followed."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Carrying an electric current that could cause an electric shock."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Dangerous or likely to cause trouble."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T11:36:25.182Z"}', '2026-11-10T11:35:37.895Z', '2026-11-10T11:36:25.182Z', NULL);
