ges meaning, or renders the word in another sense), or is not natural, fluent text in its language."}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"dog","pos":"noun","gloss":"A woman considered physically unattractive.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A domesticated animal with four legs, a tail, and a barking voice, often kept as a pet or trained for work."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A male dog or a male of a related animal such as a fox."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person, especially a man, regarded as unpleasant or contemptible."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To follow someone closely and persistently."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To cause persistent trouble or difficulty for someone or something."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A man described in a familiar or affectionate way as having a particular quality."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person''s feet."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A hot dog."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T08:34:56.899Z"}', '2026-11-10T08:16:51.021Z', '2026-11-10T08:34:56.899Z', NULL);
