er than is comfortable.\"\n- (adjective) \"Served at a high temperature after being heated or cooked.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"hot","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Recent enough to provide promising clues about someone or something being sought.","siblings":[{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a high temperature or a temperature higher than is comfortable."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Served at a high temperature after being heated or cooked."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T23:23:53.669Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:23:41.486Z', '2026-11-09T23:23:53.669Z', NULL);
