 does not work as that part of speech.\n- It renders a phrase or phrasal verb that contains the word instead of the word in this sense.\n- It renders a different sense of the word, such as one of the other senses listed below.\n- It is unnatural or ungrammatical in the target language.\n- It lists equivalents of several unrelated senses.\nOther senses of this entry, for reference:\n- (noun) \"An animal with feathers, wings, and a beak that lays eggs and is usually able to fly.\"\n- (noun) \"A person of a particular type or character.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"bird","pos":"noun","gloss":"A girl or young woman.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal with feathers, wings, and a beak that lays eggs and is usually able to fly."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular type or character."}]},"target":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T08:35:53.485Z"}', '2026-11-09T08:35:50.105Z', '2026-11-09T08:35:53.485Z', NULL);
