r type or character.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"bird","pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal with feathers, wings, and a beak that lays eggs and is usually able to fly.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A girl or young woman."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular type or character."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T23:03:26.622Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:03:15.394Z', '2026-11-09T23:03:26.622Z', NULL);
