 a man, regarded as unpleasant or contemptible."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To follow someone closely and persistently."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To cause persistent trouble or difficulty for someone or something."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A woman considered physically unattractive."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A man described in a familiar or affectionate way as having a particular quality."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A hot dog."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T15:05:40.877Z"}', '2026-11-10T15:05:27.461Z', '2026-11-10T15:05:40.877Z', NULL);
