rops, or changes meaning, or renders the word in another sense), or is not natural, fluent text in its language."}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"cat","pos":"noun","gloss":"A small domesticated animal with soft fur, whiskers, and retractable claws, often kept as a pet.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A wild animal of the same family as the domestic cat, including lions, tigers, and leopards."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person, especially a man."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T08:57:31.557Z"}', '2026-11-10T08:36:46.819Z', '2026-11-10T08:57:31.557Z', NULL);
