leasure.\"\n- (noun) \"A person who receives special affection or preferential treatment from someone.\"\n- (verb) \"To stroke or touch an animal gently and affectionately.\"\n- (verb) \"To kiss and caress someone in a sexual way.\"\n- (noun) \"A kind or lovable person, especially one addressed affectionately.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"pet","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Receiving special personal interest, attention, or affection.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal kept for companionship or pleasure."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person who receives special affection or preferential treatment from someone."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To stroke or touch an animal gently and affectionately."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To kiss and caress someone in a sexual way."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A kind or lovable person, especially one addressed affectionately."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T05:16:22.467Z"}', '2026-11-10T05:16:17.033Z', '2026-11-10T05:16:22.467Z', NULL);
