n equivalent does not work as that part of speech.\n- It renders a phrase or phrasal verb that contains the word instead of the word in this sense.\n- It renders a different sense of the word, such as one of the other senses listed below.\n- It is unnatural or ungrammatical in the target language.\n- It lists equivalents of several unrelated senses.\nOther senses of this entry, for reference:\n- (noun) \"A domesticated animal with four legs, a tail, and a barking voice, often kept as a pet or trained for work.\"\n- (noun) \"A male dog or a male of a related animal such as a fox.\"\n- (noun) \"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure.\"\n- (verb) \"To follow someone closely and persistently.\"\n- (verb) \"To cause persistent trouble or difficulty for someone or something.\"\n- (noun) \"A woman considered physically unattractive.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"dog","pos":"noun","gloss":"A person, especially a man, regarded as unpleasant or contemptible.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A domesticated animal with four legs, a tail, and a barking voice, often kept as a pet or trained for work."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A male dog or a male of a related animal such as a fox."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To follow someone closely and persistently."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To cause persistent trouble or difficulty for someone or something."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A woman considered physically unattractive."}]},"target":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T08:51:21.081Z"}', '2026-11-09T08:51:16.542Z', '2026-11-09T08:51:21.081Z', NULL);
