pt as a pet.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"cat","pos":"noun","gloss":"A wild animal of the same family as the domestic cat, including lions, tigers, and leopards.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A small domesticated animal with soft fur, whiskers, and retractable claws, often kept as a pet."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T23:06:22.398Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:06:09.838Z', '2026-11-09T23:06:22.398Z', NULL);
