ds."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular kind or character."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To pull or take something out of a place, especially with difficulty."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T03:34:01.809Z"}', '2026-11-10T03:33:56.945Z', '2026-11-10T08:58:00.524Z', NULL);
