anges meaning, or renders the word in another sense), or is not natural, fluent text in its language."}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"cold","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Showing no emotion or pity when harming others.","siblings":[{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a low temperature or a temperature lower than is comfortable."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Feeling a lack of warmth in the body."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Served without being heated or after being allowed to cool."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Showing little affection, sympathy, or friendliness."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Based on facts and reasoning without the influence of emotion."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"No longer fresh enough to provide useful clues about someone or something being sought."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Far from finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Giving an impression of coolness through blue, green, or grey tones."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Unconscious."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A common viral infection of the nose and throat that causes sneezing, a runny nose, and sometimes a cough."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A low temperature, especially in the weather or surrounding air."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Without preparation, practice, or prior knowledge."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Suddenly and completely."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Done without preparation or prior knowledge."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Completely and accurately from memory."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Unpleasant or depressing because it offers no comfort or hope."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T10:38:25.920Z"}', '2026-11-10T10:36:34.032Z', '2026-11-10T10:38:25.920Z', NULL);
