d a barking voice, often kept as a pet or trained for work.\"\n- (noun) \"A male dog or a male of a related animal such as a fox.\"\n- (noun) \"A person, especially a man, regarded as unpleasant or contemptible.\"\n- (noun) \"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure.\"\n- (verb) \"To follow someone closely and persistently.\"\n- (noun) \"A woman considered physically unattractive.\"\n- (noun) \"A man described in a familiar or affectionate way as having a particular quality.\"\n- (noun) \"A person''s feet.\"\n- (noun) \"A hot dog.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"dog","pos":"verb","gloss":"To cause persistent trouble or difficulty for someone or something.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A domesticated animal with four legs, a tail, and a barking voice, often kept as a pet or trained for work."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A male dog or a male of a related animal such as a fox."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person, especially a man, regarded as unpleasant or contemptible."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To follow someone closely and persistently."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A woman considered physically unattractive."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A man described in a familiar or affectionate way as having a particular quality."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person''s feet."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A hot dog."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T11:15:31.267Z"}', '2026-11-10T11:15:23.949Z', '2026-11-10T11:15:31.267Z', NULL);
