 young woman.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"bird","pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular type or character.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal with feathers, wings, and a beak that lays eggs and is usually able to fly."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A girl or young woman."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T23:03:25.059Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:03:15.409Z', '2026-11-09T23:03:25.059Z', NULL);
