istent about making sure a rule or standard is followed."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Carrying an electric current that could cause an electric shock."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Dangerous or likely to cause trouble."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very bright and strong in colour."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T15:11:37.206Z"}', '2026-11-10T00:52:55.291Z', '2026-11-10T15:11:37.206Z', NULL);
